      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "mrP7BRkK6B4_myRWd43kB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12590.344420906129,
      "y": 2247.6251456844802,
      "width": 731.7780761718747,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "c582vxAEYuS_QhCQPeYjB"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1357378376,
      "version": 1614,
      "versionNonce": 449104968,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788957880467,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The most fundamental unit of representation for computers is the bit.\nHowever the representation varies whether the numbers in question are\nintegers or real numbers.\n\nInteger representations: \n    - INT8\n    - INT16 \n    - INT32 \n    - etc\nThey are simply represented as a sequence of bits.\n\n            \n            bit position:   b7   b6   b5   b4   b3   b2   b1   b0\n                               │    │    │    │    │    │    │    │\n            power of 2:    2⁷   2⁶   2⁵   2⁴   2³   2²   2¹   2⁰\n            value:         128   64   32   16    8    4    2    1\n            \n                            ← increasing significance\n\nDifferent range at memory cost:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The most fundamental unit of representation for computers is the bit. However the representation varies whether the numbers in question are integers or real numbers.\n\nInteger representations: \n    - INT8\n    - INT16 \n    - INT32 \n    - etc\nThey are simply represented as a sequence of bits.\n\n            \n            bit position:   b7   b6   b5   b4   b3   b2   b1   b0\n                               │    │    │    │    │    │    │    │\n            power of 2:    2⁷   2⁶   2⁵   2⁴   2³   2²   2¹   2⁰\n            value:         128   64   32   16    8    4    2    1\n            \n                            ← increasing significance\n\nDifferent range at memory cost:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
