      "originalText": "In the original GPTQ paper, they use uniform per-row asymmetric min–max quantization. So for one row of weights \\(w\\), you take:\n\n\n\n\n\nFor a \\(b\\)-bit quantizer, the integer range has roughly\n\n\n\n\n\nsteps, so the scale is",
