      "seed": 655143738,
      "version": 938,
      "versionNonce": 452351206,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789027095060,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Results",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Results",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c1mEDYCrPLWmzfzXoVRZN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4956.967264138186,
      "y": 7570.663774801527,
      "width": 1026.778076171875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "4llD8N3L7AM4zxMc56fpK",
        "q3ginelNZeoG7_uD3qkaw"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bP3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 541473786,
      "version": 3170,
      "versionNonce": 1483130918,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789027095060,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "There is one subtle difference from LLM.int8(). LLM.int8() searches for extreme outlier activations, with\nexplicit criteria such as magnitude \\(\\ge 6\\), recurrence across layers, etc. AWQ does not use that\nsame outlier criterion. Instead, it computes a simpler per-channel activation importance statistic,\nessentially the average activation magnitude:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "There is one subtle difference from LLM.int8(). LLM.int8() searches for extreme outlier activations, with explicit criteria such as magnitude \\(\\ge 6\\), recurrence across layers, etc. AWQ does not use that same outlier criterion. Instead, it computes a simpler per-channel activation importance statistic, essentially the average activation magnitude:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "A0PLdTZSWMZRRtB0zgQ--",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4609.162736855471,
      "y": 7498.163774801527,
      "width": 263.9290771484375,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "2fnFqpFUHUAYbEX9C1Qc0",
        "q3ginelNZeoG7_uD3qkaw"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bP4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1926278330,
      "version": 763,
      "versionNonce": 1306973030,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789027095060,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AWQ vs LLM.int8() ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AWQ vs LLM.int8() ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gWOTgDDWwQVYhtZ46Zp_2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4946.562414849959,
      "y": 7874.448518374149,
      "width": 1026.778076171875,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "_14J2Q5gOSktfjQ0s7mQR",
        "SFAUPbItvd-OQHiIjy6fo",
        "SMCj_kbSA_HF-n7wflyzg"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bP5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 340723066,
      "version": 3318,
      "versionNonce": 96695974,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789027095060,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GPTQ tries to minimize something like:\n\n\n\n\nbut then it modifies other weights to compensate using Hessian information.\nAWQ instead searches for a better parameterization:\n\n\n\n\nThe weights themselves are not reconstructed si it uses a single parameter \\(\\alpha\\) to control the\nprotection strength.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GPTQ tries to minimize something like:\n\n\n\n\nbut then it modifies other weights to compensate using Hessian information.\nAWQ instead searches for a better parameterization:\n\n\n\n\nThe weights themselves are not reconstructed si it uses a single parameter \\(\\alpha\\) to control the protection strength.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
